Qwen3.8-27B-Fable-Distill-OptiQ-4.5bpw-mixedcjudge          40  0kind=open: no mechanical gradi             n=1      —       —    100      -  ok

REPORTING RULE (AGENTS.md): report these SEPARATELY — no composites.
  1 capability  — acc/pass@1 + CI, plus the exclusive-solve sets
  2 edit competence — well-formed / malformed / context-exhaustion rates
  3 latency     — mean/median/p95 seconds per task
  4 runaway tax — non-self-terminating RATE and its measured share of wall-clock
conv% and nonconv kinds are DIAGNOSTICS, not a pass/fail: the conv%>=90 gate is WITHDRAWN.
strict = THE RANKING KEY at a matched budget: a DNF scores 0 with the denominator INTACT,
  so a model that DNFs 99 of 100 tasks scores 1%, not 100%. Comparable only at an EQUAL
  thinking_budget (compare refuses otherwise); the budget is shown in the detail line.
acc = correctness over generated items (historical meaning), kept so published rows stay
  comparable. pass@1|conv is a DIAGNOSTIC and must NEVER rank — it conditions on
  convergence, shrinking the denominator, which is the 99-DNF pathology above.
'harness' is BROKEN only when the HARNESS failed, not the model.
degen = self-terminating repetition loops: scored CONVERGED and included in acc, flagged
for the judge panel; their wall/token share is COST, reported beside capability.
Full scores -> $STACK_REPO/benchmark/results/scores.json

